Reason: Color_RGB8[4] with no reader anywhere; its shape matches the particleColors table declared locally in EfcErupc_UpdateParticles, so it reads as that table's discarded earlier revision.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Efc_Erupc/z_efc_erupc.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.

